Conflicts: calamares-settings-debian
Replaces: calamares-settings-debian
Description: VeltOS installer configuration and branding
 Configures the Calamares installer used on the VeltOS live system:
  * VeltOS branding, slideshow (English/Turkish) and "Install VeltOS"
    desktop icon;
  * UEFI installs with the Secure Boot chain (shim + signed GRUB) and
    os-prober, so Windows appears in the boot menu of dual-boot systems;
  * offline installation of bootloader packages from the install medium;
  * APT sources for the installed system with all archive components.
 .
 Based on calamares-settings-debian by Jonathan Carter (ISC licence).
